# Transcribed from Table 3 of the paper below (C and O as in its Table 1(b), +25 C; H refined
# from neutron WAND data). Minus signs recovered from the PDF text layer. Not a COD entry.
# The paper names the space group P1211 but prints no symmetry operators. The 2-fold screw axis
# is placed at x = 1/4, z = 1/4: of the settings that keep the chains apart, only this one gives
# the near-P212121 pseudo-symmetry (h00, 0k0 absences) the paper reports for the same structure.
